      "sourceWitness": {
        "unitId": "s0078",
        "zh": "伯父蒨，步兵校尉，爲世碩儒。",
        "quotedFormsInUnit": [
          "伯父蒨",
          "蒨"
        ],
        "absentForms": [
          "賀琛之父",
          "父"
        ]
      },
      "assessment": "He Chen’s paternal elder uncle He Qian (賀蒨) is named on s0078 via 伯父蒨. The chapter never names He Chen’s father. The blocking labels 賀琛之父 / Father of He Chen are synthesis from uncle→father inference, not quotable primary surfaces. Retain explicit uncle teaching (s0079) and remove the unnamed-father person record."
    },
    {
      "caseId": "sha256:381daba7cf8e9eb43c1188321d715eca681352a2c89c1e63d4df6a0c11e052a7",
      "localPersonId": "liangshu:038:p006",
      "canonicalPersonId": "per_SA52WDQV0FT2C35M8RBX",
      "priorReviewerVerdict": "hold",
      "ownerDisposition": "propose-remove-unwitnessed-local-person",
      "sourceWitness": {
        "unitId": "s0005",
        "zh": "异年數歲，外祖顧歡撫之，謂异祖昭之曰：「此兒非常器，當成卿門戶。」",
        "quotedFormsInUnit": [
          "异",
          "外祖顧歡",
          "异祖昭之"
        ],
        "absentForms": [
          "朱异之母",
          "母"
        ]
      },
      "relatedWitness": {
        "unitId": "s0004",
        "zh": "父巽，以義烈知名，官至齊江夏王參軍、吳平令。",
        "note": "Father Zhu Xun (p003) is explicit; mother remains unnamed in chapter."
      },
      "assessment": "Maternal grandfather Gu Huan (顧歡) and child 异 are explicit on s0005; paternal grandfather Zhao Zhi (昭之) is addressed but not named as mother. 朱异之母 is a fabricated descriptive-kinship surface with no Chinese witness. Remove p006; keep p003 father and p005 外祖 links."
    }
  ],
